---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing & Website Services for Therapists | Brighter Sites"
  description="Website design, online launch setup, and ongoing website care for therapists and counseling practices. Website projects start at $1,500."
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Pricing & Services</p>

      <h1>A professional web presence without unnecessary complexity.</h1>

      <p class="page-lead">
        Brighter Sites designs, builds, launches, and supports websites for
        therapists and counseling practices. Start with the website itself or
        choose a more complete online launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Website packages</p>
        <h2>Start with the level of help your practice needs.</h2>

        <p>
          These prices cover most solo and small-practice projects. Larger,
          more complex, or highly customized projects are quoted separately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <article class="pricing-card">
          <p class="pricing-label">Professional Website</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">Starting at $1,500</p>

          <p>
            A custom website designed around your practice, services, and the
            experience you want prospective clients to have.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Custom visual design and page layouts</li>
            <li>Responsive mobile, tablet, and desktop development</li>
            <li>Practice, clinician, service, and contact pages as needed</li>
            <li>Search-ready page structure and metadata</li>
            <li>Domain connection and technical launch</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Start a website project</a>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-card pricing-card-featured">
          <p class="pricing-label">Complete Online Launch</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$2,000</p>

          <p>
            For a new practice that wants the website and the surrounding
            online foundation handled together.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Everything in the Professional Website package</li>
            <li>Google Workspace setup</li>
            <li>Google Business Profile setup and optimization</li>
            <li>Domain, Cloudflare, and DNS configuration</li>
            <li>Google Search Console and Analytics setup</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="button" href="/contact/">Plan my online launch</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Optional setup services</p>
        <h2>Need help with only part of your online setup?</h2>

        <p>
          These services can be added individually when you do not need the
          complete launch package.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$250</span>
          <h3>Google Workspace setup</h3>
          <p>
            Business email setup, domain verification, and the essential
            Workspace configuration for your practice.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$250</span>
          <h3>Google Business Profile</h3>
          <p>
            Setup and optimization of your practice listing so your core
            business information is complete and consistent.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$200</span>
          <h3>Domain, Cloudflare & DNS</h3>
          <p>
            Domain connection, DNS configuration, Cloudflare setup, and the
            technical records needed for your website and email.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <span class="feature-number price-badge">$150</span>
          <h3>Search Console & Analytics</h3>
          <p>
            Connect the tools needed to understand search visibility and basic
            website traffic after launch.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ongoing website care</p>
        <h2>Keep the site healthy after launch.</h2>

        <p>
          Ongoing care is optional. Choose the level that matches how much
          maintenance and hands-on support you want.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid pricing-grid-three">
        <article class="pricing-card">
          <p class="pricing-label">Site Monitor</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$29<span>/month</span></p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Website uptime monitoring</li>
            <li>SSL and domain checks</li>
            <li>Basic site health monitoring</li>
            <li>Semiannual visual review</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-card">
          <p class="pricing-label">Site Care</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$79<span>/month</span></p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Everything in Site Monitor</li>
            <li>Monthly website review</li>
            <li>Up to 30 minutes of small changes or maintenance</li>
            <li>Routine technical upkeep</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="pricing-card pricing-card-featured">
          <p class="pricing-label">Managed Growth</p>
          <p class="pricing-price">$179<span>/month</span></p>

          <p>
            For practices that want someone actively reviewing the website,
            interpreting the data, and making useful improvements—not simply
            monitoring whether the site is online.
          </p>

          <ul class="pricing-list">
            <li>Everything in Site Care</li>
            <li>Monthly Analytics and Search Console review</li>
            <li>Visitor behavior and conversion-path review</li>
            <li>SEO, content, and website opportunities prioritized for you</li>
            <li>1–1.5 hours of website work each month to act on findings</li>
            <li>Routine content, CTA, metadata, and small site updates</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="text-link" href="/work/">See how managed website growth works →</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="pricing-note">
        Additional work outside a care plan is calculated at $100 per hour in
        15-minute increments, but billable work does not begin without your
        approval. Send us the change you want and we will review the scope and
        provide a written quote for that defined work. Once you approve it,
        that is the price for the quoted scope. If the request changes, we will
        confirm a revised quote with you before doing additional work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container service-detail-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What every website includes</p>
        <h2>Built around real practice needs.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-list">
        <div>
          <h3>Clear navigation</h3>
          <p>
            Visitors should be able to understand where they are and find
            important information without hunting for it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Strong mobile experience</h3>
          <p>
            Contact buttons, menus, service information, and calls to action
            remain easy to use on a phone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Thoughtful client pathways</h3>
          <p>
            We make it obvious how someone can learn more, request an
            appointment, or reach the appropriate client portal.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3>Performance and maintainability</h3>
          <p>
            Sites are built to remain fast, understandable, and practical to
            maintain as the practice changes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Have an existing site?</p>
        <h2>You may not need to start from zero.</h2>

        <p>
          We can review an existing therapy website and determine whether a
          focused redesign or a complete rebuild makes more sense.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk about your site</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
